{"unit_id": "tag:01NL:statement", "translation": "假设与上文引理<REF_0001>中的相同。\n态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>的像（image）未必包含在层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>可逆（invertible）的点集（locus）中。\n下面给出一个例子。\n设<MATH_0003>为域（field）。\n令<MATH_0004>按<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>分次（graded）。\n置<MATH_0008>。\n设<MATH_0009>。\n回顾<MATH_0010>是可逆（invertible）的，并且<MATH_0011>。\n考虑复合（composition）<MATH_0012>，它由下列映射（maps）给出\n<MATH_0013>\n这里第一个映射（map）由<MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016>给出，第二个映射（map）是（<REF_0002>）。\n由该引理，这对应于一个态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0017>\n易见它是满射（surjective）。另一方面，我们在注记<REF_0003>中已证明，层（sheaf）<MATH_0018>并非在<MATH_0019>的每个点（points）处都可逆（invertible）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "locus", "target_term": "点集"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "讨论其像的态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指该态射的像"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "讨论其可逆性的层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定层在何处可逆"}, {"source_term": "locus", "target_term": "点集", "context": "由层的可逆性确定的点集"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "例子所取的域"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指定例子中的分次"}, {"sour